# Every text file keeps LF on every checkout, Windows' too. Tests hold what
# is committed to the bytes it is written as: the protocol fixtures and the
# measured ones read and written again, a shipped profile to what Save writes,
# the report's template text, the Node SDK's tests reading its own source.
# A Windows checkout made them CRLF (core.autocrlf) and every one of those
# differed there (CI run 40222769334).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Captured bytes, never text, whatever they happen to hold.
*.bin binary
